-/// Extracts #tags from a note's body text, in the order they appear.
-///
-/// A tag is a `#` followed by a run of tag characters (letters, digits,
-/// underscore, hyphen, or slash). The `#` may appear anywhere in the text,
-/// so it works even when a tag is glued to surrounding punctuation such as
